      "title": "Investor sentiment deteriorates as stock falls 16%",
      "body": "After last week's 16% share price decline to ₹39.94, the stock trades at a trailing P/E ratio of 13.9x. Average trailing P/E is 22x in the IT industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 9.2% over the past three years.",
